00:01:00 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :UNDEF
00:01:09 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :The consensus is to reflect, I think
00:01:27 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: Obviously nkxy for n <= 0 actually jumps n instructions after the y.
00:01:29 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :So:
00:01:31 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :0kxy --> y
00:01:34 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :-1kxyz --> z
00:01:41 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :-2kabcd --> d
