00:49:41 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :'
00:49:42 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :^ full fungespace
00:49:47 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :That pushes the character ' forever, right? :D
00:49:52 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :No, it pushes a space
00:50:02 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :Conceptually, your program is embedded in an infinite sea of spaces
00:50:17 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :And ' fetches the next cell, not instruction.
00:51:06 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: Oh, I see.
00:51:09 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: So no wrapping there.
00:51:18 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :so
00:51:19 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :doCharIns '\'' = advance *> (push <$> peekHere)
00:51:20 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Is wrong.
00:51:22 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :But I can fix it!
00:52:13 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :Note that this is also why # over the edge of the program shouldn't skip anything on the other side, IMO. (Mycology calls it an UNDEF because I haven't bothered to change it, and Vorpal might get pissed at me.)
