07:21:41 :nrkn!3ceaa170@gateway/web/freenode/ip.60.234.161.112 PRIVMSG #esoteric :I guess my goals are a) terse, b) high level, c) mnemonic. I mean, you could just look at the classes of problems that are most commonly solved and map value types and operators to unicode chars according to most used, but it would be really hard to remember how to do anything, so the mnemonic part is important
07:21:42 :fizzie!fis@iris.zem.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :This was in 1993; it was for DOS.
07:21:48 :quintopia!~quintopia@unaffiliated/quintopia PRIVMSG #esoteric :oh
