07:26:07 :quintopia!~quintopia@unaffiliated/quintopia PRIVMSG #esoteric :fizzie: so you were 10 years old in 93? yeah, i'm sure that was kinda before your time too :P
07:26:09 :pikhq!~pikhq@174-22-169-62.clsp.qwest.net PRIVMSG #esoteric :quintopia: Perhaps some of the stuff *you* notice is for Windows. Probably because a lot of that is positively *stunning*.
