11:43:01 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :before I discovered that, though, I'd optimised the memory usage for all the rest of the code first
11:43:08 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :mergeByteString (ox,oy) fs = snd . foldl' line (oy,fs) . B8.lines . B.filter (/= ff)
11:43:09 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :  where line (y,fs) s    = (y+1, snd $ B.foldl' (byte y) (ox,fs) s)
11:43:09 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :        byte y (x,fs) w  = (x+1, if w == space then fs else insertFS (x,y) (fromIntegral w) fs)
11:43:09 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :TODO:
11:43:10 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :remove filter
11:43:13 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :remove B8.lines
11:43:17 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :make this the most insane fold ever
11:44:11 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :hmm, seeing that on my IRC client gives me the idea of writing code in a proportional-width font, and using all the whitespace characters in Unicode to make it line up perfectly anyway
11:44:26 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :except vertical tab, because nobody seems to know what it's meant to do any more, and it's normally just interpreted as newline
11:46:24 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :mergeByteString :: Vector -> FungeSpace -> ByteString -> FungeSpace
11:46:24 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :mergeByteString (ox,oy) fs = snd . foldl' byte ((ox,oy),fs,False)
11:46:24 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :  where byte (p@(x,y),fs,lastWasCR) w
11:46:24 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :          | w == ff || (w == lf && lastWasCR) = (p, fs, False)
11:46:24 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :          | w == cr || w == lf = ((x,y+1), fs, w == cr)
11:46:25 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :          | w == space = ((x+1,y), fs, False)
11:46:27 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :          | otherwise = ((x+1,y), insertFS p (fromIntegral w) fs, False)
11:46:29 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :that should do it
