12:00:03 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :ais523: the ambiguity is easily traceable to one sentence
12:00:12 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :The k "Iterate" instruction pops a value n off the stack. Then it finds the next instruction in Funge-space in the path of the IP (note that this cannot be a marker such as space or ;), treats it as an instruction, executing it n times. This takes only one tick with respect to concurrent operation.
