12:07:40 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :ais523: to me, the latter sentence could _easily_ be referring to the next instruction after the _first one_ in the path of the IP
12:07:42 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :where's the "we take an instruction"
