12:12:44 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :ais523: in stringmode, " still toggles stringmode
12:12:45 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :In stringmode, " turns off stringmode.
