12:14:16 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :ais523: except for not wrapping
12:14:18 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :elliott: it doesn't allow for wrapping
12:14:20 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :or SGML spaces
