12:16:47 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :that does seem to imply position metadata
12:16:51 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :HA
12:16:53 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :TOLD YOU
