12:20:20 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: [[The k "Iterate" instruction pops a value n off the stack. Then it finds the next instruction in Funge-space in the path of the IP]]
12:20:20 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :elliott: k definitely remembers the instruction it's executing, based on the stack
12:20:25 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :In the spec, it is a bit ambiguous
