12:21:22 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: the bit where "the next instruction" means "after the k"
12:21:26 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :elliott: It doesn't mean that
12:21:33 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: then it means "after the IP"
12:21:35 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :I was wrong and tired last time.
12:21:36 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :also, the definition of k isn't actually a sentence
