12:25:43 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :elliott: For the record, this behaviour follows from the impl "move IP; if (arg==0) return; get next instruction; move IP back; while (arg--) execute instruction;"
