13:01:14 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Or give it to ghci :)
13:01:52 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :y on positive is a pick instruction
