15:18:12 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :I mean a C FFI
15:18:16 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :so that he could bind it to C-INTERCAL
15:18:17 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :C-INTERCAL has some cfunge-only bits, I'd rather be NIH-y and write my own than add CCBI-only stuff to something else entirely
15:18:26 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: C-INTERCAL doesn't include IFFI, IIRC
15:18:32 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :So it'd be blank-slatey.
15:18:42 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :Unless I've misunderstood the extent of the connection between cfunge and its companion
15:18:43 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: OK, better idea: do it to CLC-INTERCAL using Perl's XS.
15:18:56 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: IFFI is I think just a big patch to C-INTERCAL but I might be wrong.
15:19:04 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :as well as the fingerprint implementation in cfunge
15:19:09 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Well, "big"
15:19:36 :Deewiant!~deewiant@cs186230.pp.htv.fi PRIVMSG #esoteric :Right, but I thought that the C-INTERCAL bits were at least partly cfunge-specific and not very pluggable to arbitrary interps
15:19:50 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :elliott: wrong way round, it's actually a patch to cfunge to make it fit into ick's FFI
15:19:56 :asiekierka!~asiekierk@178235033089.elblag.vectranet.pl JOIN :#esoteric
15:19:59 :ais523!~ais523@unaffiliated/ais523 PRIVMSG #esoteric :plus an expansion library to ick to implement the other side
15:20:02 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :ah
15:20:07 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: That's true, yes.
15:20:14 :elliott!~elliott@unaffiliated/elliott PRIVMSG #esoteric :Deewiant: Thus CLC-INTERCAL.
